# Secrets and local runtime data never belong in the image - the container
# gets real credentials from host env vars, and the audit/mandate DBs are
# created fresh at container start. Only the *.db files themselves are
# runtime state - backend/data/ also holds catalog.json, a static source
# file the image must ship with (excluding the whole directory here once
# broke every endpoint that reads the catalog: /catalog, /scenarios,
# /stress-cases all 500'd with FileNotFoundError on a fresh deploy).
backend/.env
backend/data/*.db

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
